AiTask qa_e2_alert_true {
  label: 'QA E2a conditional Slack alert (condition met)'
  description: 'QA test 2026-09-24, delete after test: conditional alert, expected to send.'

  brief: @md
Using the Ecommerce Official dataset, count the distinct orders created yesterday (the full previous calendar day).

If yesterday had FEWER than 120 orders, post a short alert to the Slack channel #hoa. Start the message with "[QA E2a]", then give yesterday's date, the order count, the threshold (120), and the top 3 countries by order count yesterday.

If yesterday had 120 orders or more, do not send anything.

In your final answer, state the date you checked, the order count, and whether you sent the alert.
;;

  acceptance_criteria: @md
The order count for yesterday is correct. An alert starting with "[QA E2a]" was posted to #hoa only if the count was below 120; otherwise nothing was sent. The final answer states the date, the count and the decision.
;;
}
